FILE: src/context/ThemeContext.tsx
PURPOSE: Provides app-wide theme state (light/dark mode + colour variant) via React context; persists preference to localStorage and applies data-theme attribute to <html>.
CONTEXT SHAPE (ThemeContextValue):
  mode: ThemeMode           — 'light' | 'dark'
  colorTheme: ColorTheme    — active colour name (e.g. 'sand', 'midnight')
  isDark: boolean           — convenience derived from mode
  toggleMode: () => void    — toggles light/dark, resets colour to that mode's default
  setColorTheme: (theme: ColorTheme) => void — updates colour and persists to localStorage
COMPONENT: ThemeProvider ({ children })
HOOK EXPORTED: useTheme() → ThemeContextValue
HOOKS USED: useState (×2), useEffect (×1), useContext (×1)
IMPORTS: src/types/index.ts (ThemeMode, ColorTheme, LightTheme, DarkTheme), src/styles/themes.ts (buildThemeKey)
USED_BY: src/App.tsx (wraps), src/components/TopBar.tsx, src/components/SettingsModal.tsx, src/components/ChartRenderer.tsx
